node_modules/
dist/
server/data/
server/.env
server/.env.*
!server/.env.example
*.log
.DS_Store
.pnpm-store/
.vite/
# Runtime secrets are loaded normally by server/package.json; this only keeps
# tsc 增量构建产物:每次 build 都变,跟踪它只会制造无意义的合并冲突
*.tsbuildinfo
# npm run check:render 的临时打包产物(脚本跑完会自己删,异常中断才会留下)
.render-check.bundle.mjs
# Xcode 的用户级状态和构建产物:每个人各不相同,不该进仓库
ios/**/xcuserdata/
ios/**/*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
ios/build/
ios/**/.modulecache/
